      "title": "Layers: split an image into 2 to 8 layers with Qwen Image Layered",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Layers: split an image into 2 to 8 layers with Qwen Image Layered\n\nSplits your image into 2 to 8 transparent layers with Qwen Image Layered. This file holds the draft bucket of 640 pixels on the longer side. The final run sets the bucket to 1024. Built from Comfy's template image_qwen_image_layered.\n\n## Models\n\n- [qwen_image_layered_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Layered_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_layered_bf16.safetensors): Qwen Image Layered, bf16, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Layered).\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Qwen2.5-VL 7B text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct).\n- [qwen_image_layered_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Layered_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_layered_vae.safetensors): Qwen Image Layered VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Layered).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
